# The context menu on a Logbook entry offers Uncomplete, and running it removes the entry from the Logbook.
file <<END
- Shipped @done({today})
- Earlier @done({today-1})
END
keys gL \
see Commands:
type uncomplete
keys <Enter>
hide Shipped
see ▌ ✔ Earlier
quit
saved <<END
- Shipped
- Earlier @done({today-1})
END
